<h1 class=3D"title toc-ignore">Assess diversity of the PCV data set</h1>
<h4 class=3D"author">Shaoqian Huang</h4>
<h4 class=3D"date">2026-09-24</h4>

</div>


<div id=3D"aims" class=3D"section level2">
<h2>Aims</h2>
<p>The document aims to apply the proposed model-based assessment of
diversity on the percentage cover value (PCV) data set and check if the
model-based estimation of diversity is consistent with randomized Rao=E2=80=
=99s
Q, which has been demonstrated that they are consistent in the
simulation.</p>
<p>In order to simplify the modelling the process, I keep the species
whose absence rate is lower than <span class=3D"math inline"><span class=3D=
"MathJax_Preview" style=3D"color: inherit;"></span><span class=3D"MathJax" =
