<pre class=3D"r"><code class=3D"hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-comment"># Phylog=
enetic distance matrix.</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># The order of species in DM_phy_func is the s=
ame as the order of species in subtree, and the order corresponds to sp1, s=
p2, sp3,...,sp12.</span>
DM_phy_func &lt;- cophenetic.phylo(subtree)


<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># Convert distance to a similarity-like matrix=
.</span>
VC_phy_func &lt;- max(DM_phy_func) - DM_phy_func


<span class=3D"hljs-comment"># Project the similarity matrix onto the centr=
ed subspace</span>

J &lt;- diag(p) -
  (<span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span> / p) * matrix(<span class=3D"hljs-n=
umber">1</span>, p, p)


VC_phy_func_J &lt;- J %*%
  VC_phy_func %*%
  J

V_J &lt;- eigen(VC_phy_func_J)$vectors
D_J &lt;- eigen(VC_phy_func_J)$values</code></pre>
